{y}_{\\text{new}}$ using Euler's method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′} & =4x-2y=4\\cdot 0-2\\cdot (-1)=2 \\\\ Δy & ={y}^{′}\\cdot Δx=2\\cdot \\frac{3}{2}=3 \\\\ {x}_{\\text{new}} & =x+Δx=0+\\frac{3}{2}=\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ {y}_{\\text{new}} & =y+Δy=-1+3=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe add this to our table.\n\n| $\\,x\\,$ | $\\,y\\,$ | $\\,{y}^{′}\\,$ | $\\,Δy\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $0$ | $-1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| $\\frac{3}{2}$ | $2$ | $$ | $$ |\n\n**Step 2.** We compute ${y}^{′}$ and $Δy$ (using the values of $x$ and $y$ in the second row) and new values of ${x}_{\\text{new}}$ and ${y}_{\\text{new}}$ using Euler's method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′} & =4x-2y=4\\cdot \\frac{3}{2}-2\\cdot 2=2 \\\\ Δy & ={y}^{′}\\cdot Δx=2\\cdot \\frac{3}{2}=3 \\\\ {x}_{\\text{new}} & =x+Δx=\\frac{3}{2}+\\frac{3}{2}=3 \\\\ {y}_{\\text{new}} & =y+Δy=2+3=5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe add this to our table.\n\n| $\\,x\\,$ | $\\,y\\,$ | $\\,{y}^{′}\\,$ | $\\,Δy\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $0$ | $-1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| $\\frac{3}{2}$ | $2$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| $3$ | $5$ | $$ | $$ |\n\nTherefore, we conclude that $y(3)≈5.$" 13194139535488 true] [17592186351674 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351675 13194139535488 true] [17592186351674 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351676 13194139535488 true] [17592186351674 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351677 13194139535488 true] [17592186351674 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351678 13194139535488 true] [17592186351674 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351679 13194139535488 true] [17592186351674 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535488 true] [17592186351674 1041 "selection" 13194139535488 true] [17592186351674 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351679 13194139535488 true] [17592186351674 1110 #uuid "4b3facde-2447-5e25-aa34-70989ba869df" 13194139535488 true] [17592186351675 1034 "\\frac{7}{2}" 13194139535488 true] [17592186351675 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535488 true] [17592186351675 1111 #uuid "1d0e9fc1-0a12-54c4-a295-c009de336e66" 13194139535488 true] [17592186351676 1034 "9" 13194139535488 true] 